  {
   "id": "note",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 490,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "text": "R2 bill: $0 today and $0 after; the free tier is 100 to 1000 times today's load. What the proposals buy is wall time per pass (about 0.5 s), memory,\nno torn or temp files in the storage, no lost writes between the app, the board server and agents, and a bound on how long an agent run can postpone a sync.",
